00:00:18.070 --> 00:00:23.270
will have an example for you today of a Democrat
who seems to not understand the risks here

00:00:23.270 --> 00:00:26.070
and that this could end up getting getting
screwed up.

00:00:26.070 --> 00:00:31.440
83 year old Supreme Court Justice Stephen
Breyer plans to retire.

00:00:31.440 --> 00:00:37.719
And as a result, Joe Biden will get to replace
a liberal justice with a liberal justice.

00:00:37.719 --> 00:00:43.339
